This is the replacement introduced in scikit-image 0.18, which upstream identifies
as CC0 from the photographer. It is distinct from the older restricted camera
image. It requires no access token or click-through acceptance. The harness
stages the original bytes; NPA's normal input preparation records later image
normalization, and the generated video and labels retain their run lineage.
The IAA and DIG test inputs remain repository-authored synthetic fixtures.
